# Wave W17-AA (Route 222): solar pine — a beach pine in sunlit yellow-greens, tiered and open, its highlight lifted clear of the turf, on solar turf (ground baked in). Route 222’s own tree — split from Route 213’s shore pine behind it by light entire (full sun vs salt haze) and from Route 221’s coast pine by colour: this crown is yellow-green in city light, that one blue-green in marsh air.
